---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft

# Overrides of the Microsoft preset.
UseTab: AlignWithSpaces
AccessModifierOffset: -4
PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Left
BreakTemplateDeclarations: Yes
LineEnding: CRLF

# Windows headers depend on include order (windows.h before winhttp.h, etc.),
# so do not let clang-format reorder includes.
SortIncludes: Never
...
